  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Alternate-Self Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/Lilith_Ascendant_%28FFXI%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20121204180053\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Lilith Ascendant (FFXI)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/Lilith_Ascendant_%28FFXI%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20121204180053\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/Lilith_Ascendant_%28FFXI%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20121204180053 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/39/Lilith_Ascendant_%28FFXI%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20121204180053 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Lilith Ascendant (FFXI)\" width=\"270\" height=\"369\" data-image-key=\"Lilith_Ascendant_%28FFXI%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Lilith Ascendant (FFXI).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">After she absorbed Lilisette, a good version of herself from an alternate timeline, Lady Lilith (Final Fantasy) became a powerful divine entity.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb an alternate version of oneself.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"The Multiverse, every universe in it, is irrational, sloppy. I try to make it rational. I try to make it neat. You call it murder. How can I murder myself 123 times? I just took those wasted energies and transferred them to one container: me. What if that is our fate? To unite with ourselves, to be unified forever. To be one. I will be The One.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Gabriel Yulaw (The One)</dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"What? You never heard of a flock of \"Ravens?\" I am...The Unkindness!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Multiversal Raven/The Unkindness (Teen Titans Go! Vs Teen Titans)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb/assimilate alternate versions of oneself to gain power.</b> Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-Self_Manipulation\" title=\"Alternate-Self Manipulation\">Alternate-Self Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Entity_Absorption\" title=\"Entity Absorption\">Entity Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Duplication_Absorption\" title=\"Duplication Absorption\">Duplication Absorption</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-Self_Merging\" title=\"Alternate-Self Merging\">Alternate-Self Merging</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlternate-Self_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Alternate Self-Assimilation</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlternate-Self_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb an alternate version of themselves from a different time-stream or universe to gain immense power. This power brings the user closer towards becoming a singular being and as such allows them to obtain a divine level of power if all their alternate selves are absorbed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlternate-Self_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-Self_Manipulation\" title=\"Alternate-Self Manipulation\">Alternate-Self Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-Self_Merging\" title=\"Alternate-Self Merging\">Alternate-Self Merging</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Alternate-Self_Mimicry\" title=\"Alternate-Self Mimicry\">Alternate-Self Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Collective_Entity_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Collective Entity Physiology\">Collective Entity Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Entity_Absorption\" title=\"Entity Absorption\">Entity Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gestalt_Form\" title=\"Gestalt Form\">Gestalt Form</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Imbued_Godhood\" title=\"Imbued Godhood\">Imbued Godhood</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlternate-Self_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>User may become more unstable for each alternate self that is absorbed.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlternate-Self_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Black Mage Evilwizardington (<i>8-bit Theater</i>)</li>\n<li>Mort (<i>All Hail King Julien/Madagascar</i>)</li>\n<li>Kanade Tachibana (<i>Angel Beats</i>); via Guard Skill: Absorb</li>\n<li>Eon (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>Schala/Kid (<i>Chrono Cross</i>)</li>\n<li>Captain Atom/Monarch (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Greatwyrm\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:forgottenrealms:Greatwyrm\">Greatwyrms</a> (<i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Lady_Lilith\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:finalfantasy:Lady Lilith\"> Lady Lilith</a> (<i>Final Fantasy</i> series)</li>\n<li>Yuno Gasai (<i>Future Diary</i>)</li>\n<li>Jade (<i>Homestuck</i>)</li>\n<li>Gabriel Ulaw (<i>The One</i>); via killing and absorbing their life essence.</li>\n<li>Kotarou Tennouji (<i>Rewrite</i>); Moon Timeline version only</li>\n<li>The Unkindness (<i>Teen Titans Go! VS Teen Titans</i>)</li>\n<li>Ryoko (<i>Tenchi Muyo</i>)</li>\n<li>Stephen Strange/Dr. Strange/Strange Supreme (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe/What If ...?</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAlternate-Self_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a4f48d552ce4a9e9b2ea71b1975ddd25\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=