class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Red_Dragon_-_D-D-webp\" style=\"position: relative; height:120px; width:185px; top:32.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Red_Dragon_-_D%26D.webp\" title=\"Red Dragon - D&amp;D.webp (175 KB)\" style=\"height:120px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/5a/Red_Dragon_-_D%26D.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251112135403\" title=\"Red Dragon - D&amp;D.webp (175 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Greatwyrms (Dungeons &amp; Dragons) are ancient dragons who underwent apotheosis by joining other versions of themselves throughout the multiverse into a single godlike form.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Red Dragon - D&amp;D.webp\" data-image-key=\"Red_Dragon_-_D%26D.webp\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Greatwyrms (Dungeons &amp;amp; Dragons) are ancient dragons who underwent apotheosis by joining other versions of themselves throughout the multiverse into a single godlike form.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Red Dragon - D&amp;D.webp (175 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Greatwyrms (Dungeons &amp; Dragons) are ancient dragons who underwent apotheosis by joining other versions of themselves throughout the multiverse into a single godlike form.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Red Dragon - D&amp;D.webp\" data-image-key=\"Red_Dragon_-_D%26D.webp\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Greatwyrms (Dungeons &amp;amp; Dragons) are ancient dragons who underwent apotheosis by joining other versions of themselves throughout the multiverse into a single godlike form.\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/5a/Red_Dragon_-_D%26D.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251112135403\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Greatwyrms